    <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-[var(--white)] mb-6">
      About me
    </h3>
    <div class="text-[var(--white-icon)] space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
      <p>
        I've always been curious about how things work, not just the finished
        product, but the systems underneath. That curiosity eventually became
        a career, and for the past 15 years I've been building software
